you for granted.\12As proof of your\
victory, here's\11the BOULDERBADGE!\12{PLAYER} received\
the BOULDERBADGE!")
  mod.content.text:override("5a:4252", "\12That's an official\
POKéMON LEAGUE\11BADGE!\12Its bearer's\
