  mod.content.text:override("5a:435d", "Stop right there,\
kid!\12You're still light\
years from facing\11BROCK!")
  mod.content.text:override("5a:43ec", "Darn!\12Light years isn't\
time! It measures\11distance!")
  mod.content.text:override("5a:440a", "You're pretty hot,\
but not as hot\11as BROCK!")
  mod.content.text:override("5a:4469", "Hiya! I can tell\
